        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Camilla Luddington, Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, Jo Wilson, Stephanie Edwards, Prince William\n- TV Shows and Films: Grey's Anatomy, Roseanne's Nuts, Lifetime TV film about Catherine Middleton\n- Organizations and Places: ABC, Lifetime, Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital\n- Roles and Concepts: Catherine Middleton, surgical intern, resident\n\nFacts:\n- Roseanne's Nuts is a Lifetime reality show/docudrama that aired from July 13, 2011, to September 16, 2011.\n- Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, born Catherine Elizabeth Middleton on 9 January 1982, is the wife of Prince William, Duke of Cambridge.\n- Camilla Luddington is known for playing Catherine Middleton in a Lifetime TV film and Jo Wilson in the ABC medical drama Grey's Anatomy.\n- Stephanie Edwards is introduced as a surgical intern at the fictional Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, which is later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital.\n- Stephanie Edwards advances to the resident level alongside her fellow intern and friend Jo Wilson, who is played by Camilla Luddington.",
